<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>


<!--===== Terrameld Oculus =====-->

	<HediffDef>
		<defName>ET_TerrameldEyeHediff</defName>
		<hediffClass>Hediff</hediffClass>
		<label>terrameld oculus</label>
		<labelNoun>terrameld oculi</labelNoun>
		<defaultLabelColor>(178,102,255)</defaultLabelColor>
		<description>A collection of organic bioreceptors that allow the user to see the world in an entirely different perspective. It effectively blinds the persons to most everything that wouldn't be important to a plant - which is to say, anything outside a certain radius.
That said, anything within that radius would be in incredibly sharp focus, far higher than any normal eye could possibly achieve. Lack of visual 'noise' makes anything requiring detail and finesse extremely precise.</description>
		<initialSeverity>0.1</initialSeverity>
		<stages>
			<li>
        <minSeverity>0.1</minSeverity>
        <label>greensight</label>
				<partEfficiencyOffset>-0.7</partEfficiencyOffset>
        <statOffsets>
          <WorkSpeedGlobal>0.25</WorkSpeedGlobal>
          <AimingDelayFactor>-0.5</AimingDelayFactor>
          <ShootingAccuracyPawn>-5</ShootingAccuracyPawn>
          <MeleeHitChance>1</MeleeHitChance>
          <MeleeDodgeChance>1</MeleeDodgeChance>
          <MoveSpeed>0.5</MoveSpeed>
        </statOffsets>
			</li>
      <li>
        <minSeverity>0.3</minSeverity>
        <label>II</label>
				<hungerRateFactorOffset>-0.2</hungerRateFactorOffset>
				<capMods>
					<li>
						<capacity>Moving</capacity>
						<offset>-0.1</offset>
					</li>
				</capMods>
			</li>
      <li>
        <minSeverity>0.6</minSeverity>
        <label>III</label>
				<hungerRateFactorOffset>-0.3</hungerRateFactorOffset>
				<capMods>
					<li>
						<capacity>Moving</capacity>
						<offset>-0.2</offset>
					</li>
				</capMods>
			</li>
		</stages>
	</HediffDef>

<ThingDef ParentName="ET_BodyPartOrganicBase">
    <defName>ET_NutrientRoots</defName>
    <label>nutrient microroots</label>
    <description>A family of growable, extruding roots that allows the host to passively 'feed' off nutrients and minerals in the earth. Requires an entire leg to properly maintain.</description>
    <descriptionHyperlinks>
		<RecipeDef>ET_InstallNutrientRoots</RecipeDef>
	</descriptionHyperlinks>
    <statBases>
      <Mass>0.2</Mass>
      <WorkToMake>24000</WorkToMake>
    </statBases>
  </ThingDef>

  <RecipeDef ParentName="SurgeryInstallBodyPartArtificialBase">
    <defName>ET_InstallNutrientRoots</defName>
    <label>growing nutrient microroots</label>
    <description>Grow nutrient microroots.</description>
    <descriptionHyperlinks>
      <ThingDef>ET_NutrientRoots</ThingDef>
      <HediffDef>ET_NutrientRoots</HediffDef>
    </descriptionHyperlinks>
    <jobString>Growing nutrient microroots.</jobString>
    <surgeryOutcomeEffect IsNull="True" />
    <ingredients>
      <li>
        <filter>
          <thingDefs>
            <li>ET_NutrientRoots</li>
          </thingDefs>
        </filter>
        <count>1</count>
      </li>
    </ingredients>
    <fixedIngredientFilter>
      <thingDefs>
        <li>ET_NutrientRoots</li>
      </thingDefs>
    </fixedIngredientFilter>
    <appliedOnFixedBodyParts>
      <li>Leg</li>
    </appliedOnFixedBodyParts>
    <addsHediff>ET_NutrientRootsHediff</addsHediff>
  </RecipeDef>



<!--===== Nutrient Microroots =====-->

	<HediffDef>
		<defName>ET_NutrientRootsHediff</defName>
		<hediffClass>Hediff</hediffClass>
		<label>nutrient microroots</label>
		<labelNoun>nutrient microroots</labelNoun>
		<defaultLabelColor>(178,102,255)</defaultLabelColor>
		<description>Hundreds of growths protruding from the bottom of the feet. These growths pierce the terrain and quickly absorb nutrients found within it, lowering hunger rate. Unfortunately, it also lowers movement speed.
The roots can be made larger and more effective, but keep in mind that movement speed is impacted as well.</description>
		<initialSeverity>0.1</initialSeverity>
		<stages>
			<li>
        <minSeverity>0.1</minSeverity>
        <label>I</label>
				<hungerRateFactorOffset>-0.1</hungerRateFactorOffset>
			</li>
      <li>
        <minSeverity>0.3</minSeverity>
        <label>II</label>
				<hungerRateFactorOffset>-0.2</hungerRateFactorOffset>
				<capMods>
					<li>
						<capacity>Moving</capacity>
						<offset>-0.1</offset>
					</li>
				</capMods>
			</li>
      <li>
        <minSeverity>0.6</minSeverity>
        <label>III</label>
				<hungerRateFactorOffset>-0.3</hungerRateFactorOffset>
				<capMods>
					<li>
						<capacity>Moving</capacity>
						<offset>-0.2</offset>
					</li>
				</capMods>
			</li>
		</stages>
	</HediffDef>

